      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT A NOTE (6) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from PHOENIX UMBRELLA in second (18.32) at this track. Has good speed so he should be prominent despite the draw. Key chance in this line up. PHOENIX UMBRELLA (4) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at Temora over 330m behind Sizzle Jack (19.14) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Cannot be taken lightly. TOMMY'S AVA (8) failed to come into contention last start at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (22.62) beating Skedaddle Benny in a Grade 5 on August 22. The form from her last run stacks up well. Expected to give a good account. TINY BIANCA (1) looks an each-way chance.",
